OL,3,AFour hurt and seven arrested in Bromley
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fight is believed to have taken place
OL,7,Fnear a KFC restaurant. KFC has told the
OL,8,FBBC the attack did not happen within
OL,9,Fthe premises, and would not comment on
OL,10,Feyewitness accounts that a situation
OL,11,Fbegan there and spilled into the
OL,12,Fstreet.
